        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32520-32532"><rb>火</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32532-32550">がどツさり。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32550-32565"><rb>炭</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32565-32568">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32568-32583"><rb>安</rb><rt>やす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32583-32589">い。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32589-32613"><rb>有難</rb><rt>ありがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32613-32619">い。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32619-32646"><rb>平泉</rb><rt>ひらいづみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32646-32649">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32649-32673"><rb>晝食</rb><rt>ちうじき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32673-32682">でも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32682-32703"><rb>昨夜</rb><rt>ゆうべ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32703-32727"><rb>松島</rb><rt>まつしま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32727-32745">のホテルでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32745-32757"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32757-32778">うだつた。が、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32778-32790"><rb>火</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32790-32808">がどツさり。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32808-32823"><rb>炭</rb><rt>すみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32823-32826">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32826-32841"><rb>安</rb><rt>やす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32841-32847">い。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32847-32871"><rb>有難</rb><rt>ありがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32871-32877">い。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32877-32901"><rb>鐵瓶</rb><rt>てつびん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32901-32904">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32904-32916"><rb>湯</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32916-32940">はたぎる。まだお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32940-32964"><rb>茶代</rb><rt>ちやだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32964-32967">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32967-32988"><rb>差上</rb><rt>さしあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32988-33006">げないのに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33006-33027"><rb>相濟</rb><rt>あひす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33027-33039">まない、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33039-33054"><rb>清</rb><rt>きよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33054-33063">らかな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33063-33090"><rb>菓子器</rb><rt>くわしき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33090-33093">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33093-33108"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33108-33138">は、ほこりのかゝらぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-33138-33168"><rb>蒸菓子</rb><rt>むしぐわし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-33168-33185">であつた。</seg></p>
