        <p><seg source="#source-35706-35709">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35709-35721"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35721-35736">のくらゐな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35736-35751"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35751-35754">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35754-35778"><rb>學校</rb><rt>がくかう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35778-35781">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35781-35796"><rb>覺</rb><rt>おぼ</rt></ruby>えたよ。」</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-35813-35816">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35816-35840"><rb>感心</rb><rt>かんしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35840-35843">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35843-35864"><rb>道理</rb><rt>だうり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35864-35867">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35867-35891"><rb>落第</rb><rt>らくだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35891-35894">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35894-35909"><rb>遊</rb><rt>あそ</rt></ruby>ばさないで。」</p>
        <p>「お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35938-35962"><rb>手柔</rb><rt>てやはら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35962-35968">かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35968-35983"><rb>願</rb><rt>ねが</rt></ruby>ひます。」</p>
